Package: h3compactR
Title: Polygon Coverage, Compaction and Aggregation for H3 Spatial Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Rob", "Andronaco",
    email = "robertandronaco@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:
    Provides a compact workflow for representing polygons with H3 cells,
    compacting those cells using established H3 methods, maintaining
    relationships between source and compacted cells, aggregating attributes,
    and validating the resulting spatial representation. The package builds
    on the H3 ecosystem and the h3jsr package, with a focus on reproducible
    spatial analysis and cartographic workflows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0),
    sf
Imports:
    cli,
    h3jsr,
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
